</span></span><span>
</span><span>
</span><span><span></span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(129, 136, 152);"># ── Clase 1: Cliente ────────────────────────────────────────</span><span>
</span></span><span><span></span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(129, 136, 152);"># Origen: actor "Cliente registrado" (Celda 1 + CU-001)</span><span>
</span></span><span><span></span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(129, 136, 152);"># RF: RF-001 (registro), RF-002 (autenticación),</span><span>
