===================================</span><span>
</span></span><span><span></span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(129, 136, 152);"># CELDA 8 — Flujo principal de la aplicación</span><span>
</span></span><span><span></span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(129, 136, 152);"># ============================================================</span><span>
</span></span><span>
</span><span><span></span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(204, 123, 244);">def</span><span> </span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(112, 184, 255);">main</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">(</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">)</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">:</span><span>
</span></span><span><span>    </span><span class="token token triple-quoted-string" style="color: rgb(155, 233, 99);">"""Simula el flujo completo de una compra en Coquito Amarillo S.A.S."""</span><span>
</span></span><span><span>    </span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(204, 123, 244);">print</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">(</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(155, 233, 99);">"="</span><span> </span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(234, 236, 240);">*</span><span> </span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(94, 237, 237);">55</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">)</span><span>
</span></span><span><span>    </span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(204, 123, 244);">print</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">(</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(155, 233, 99);">"  COQUITO AMARILLO S.A.S. — Simulación de Compra"</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">)</span><span>
</span></span><span><span>    </span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(204, 123, 244);">print</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">(</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(155, 233, 99);">"="</span><span> </span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(234, 236, 240);">*</span><span> </span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(94, 237, 237);">55</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">)</span><span>
</span></span><span>
</span><span><span>    </span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(129, 136, 152);"># ── Paso 1: Crear datos de prueba ──────────────────────────</span><span>
