</span></span><span><span></span><span class="token token list" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">-</span><span> </span><span class="token token bold" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">**</span><span class="token token bold content">Base de datos:</span><span class="token token bold" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">**</span><span> SQLite + SQLAlchemy
</span></span><span><span></span><span class="token token list" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">-</span><span> </span><span class="token token bold" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">**</span><span class="token token bold content">Pruebas:</span><span class="token token bold" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">**</span><span> pytest + httpx
</span></span><span><span></span><span class="token token list" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">-</span><span> </span><span class="token token bold" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">**</span><span class="token token bold content">CI/CD:</span><span class="token token bold" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">**</span><span> GitHub Actions
