          ease-[cubic-bezier(0.165,0.85,0.45,1)] h-8 w-8 rounded-md backdrop-blur-md _fill_10ocf_9 _ghost_10ocf_96" type="button" aria-label="Copiar al portapapeles" data-state="closed"><div class="relative"><div class="transition-all opacity-100 scale-100" style="width: 20px; height: 20px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="transition-all opacity-100 scale-100" aria-hidden="true" style="flex-shrink: 0;"><path d="M12.5 3A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 14 4.5V6h1.5A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 17 7.5v8a1.5 1.5 0 0 1-1.5 1.5h-8A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 6 15.5V14H4.5A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 3 12.5v-8A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 4.5 3zm1.5 9.5a1.5 1.5 0 0 1-1.5 1.5H7v1.5a.5.5 0 0 0 .5.5h8a.5.5 0 0 0 .5-.5v-8a.5.5 0 0 0-.5-.5H14zM4.5 4a.5.5 0 0 0-.5.5v8a.5.5 0 0 0 .5.5h8a.5.5 0 0 0 .5-.5v-8a.5.5 0 0 0-.5-.5z"></path></svg></div><div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center"><div class="transition-all opacity-0 scale-50" style="width: 20px; height: 20px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="transition-all opacity-0 scale-50" aria-hidden="true" style="flex-shrink: 0;"><path d="M15.188 5.11a.5.5 0 0 1 .752.626l-.056.084-7.5 9a.5.5 0 0 1-.738.033l-3.5-3.5-.064-.078a.501.501 0 0 1 .693-.693l.078.064 3.113 3.113 7.15-8.58z"></path></svg></div></div></div></button></div></div><div class="overflow-x-auto"><pre class="code-block__code !my-0 !rounded-lg !text-sm !leading-relaxed p-3.5" style="color: rgb(234, 236, 240); background: transparent; font-family: var(--font-mono);"><code style="color: rgb(234, 236, 240); background: transparent; font-family: var(--font-mono); white-space: pre-wrap;"><span><span>5. Haz clic en **Execute**
</span></span><span>6. Si el registro es exitoso recibirás tu `id_cliente`
</span><span>
</span><span>---
</span><span>
</span><span>## 3. Iniciar Sesión
</span><span>1. Busca `POST /auth/login`
</span><span>2. Ingresa correo y contraseña
</span><span>3. Recibirás tu `id_cliente` y nombre
</span><span>&gt; ⚠️ Tras 5 intentos fallidos tu cuenta quedará bloqueada
</span><span>
</span><span>---
</span><span>
</span><span>## 4. Explorar el Catálogo
</span><span>1. Busca `GET /productos/`
</span><span>2. Haz clic en **Try it out** → **Execute**
</span><span>3. Verás la lista de productos disponibles con precio y stock
</span><span>4. Puedes filtrar por categoría agregando el parámetro `categoria`
</span><span>
</span><span>---
</span><span>
</span><span>## 5. Agregar Productos al Carrito
</span><span>1. Busca `POST /carrito/{id_cliente}/items`
</span><span>2. Ingresa tu `id_cliente`
</span><span>3. Ingresa el `id_producto` y la `cantidad` deseada:</span></code></pre></div></div>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-pre-wrap leading-[1.7]">{
"id_producto": 1,
"cantidad": 2
}</p>
