</span></span><span>### Cobertura esperada por módulo:
</span><span>| Módulo | Pruebas |
</span><span>|---|---|
</span><span>| test_auth.py | 7 pruebas — registro, login, logout, bloqueo |
</span><span>| test_productos.py | 8 pruebas — CRUD, stock, desactivar |
</span><span>| test_pedidos.py | 9 pruebas — registro, estados, cancelación |
</span><span>| test_pagos.py | 8 pruebas — pago, comprobante, reembolso |
</span><span>
</span><span>---
</span><span>
</span><span>## 7. CI/CD
</span><span>El proyecto usa GitHub Actions para ejecutar las pruebas automáticamente en cada push a MainBranch.
</span><span>
</span><span>Archivo de configuración: `.github/workflows/ci.yml`
</span><span>
</span><span>El pipeline ejecuta:
</span><span>1. Instalación de dependencias
</span><span>2. Pruebas con cobertura (pytest)
</span><span>3. Análisis de calidad del código (pylint, score mínimo 7.0)
</span><span>
</span><span>---
</span><span>
</span><span>## 8. Normas de Calidad Aplicadas
</span><span>- **ISO/IEC 25010** — Funcionalidad, rendimiento, seguridad y mantenibilidad
</span><span>- **IEEE 730** — Plan de aseguramiento de calidad con revisiones y pruebas
</span><span>- **PEP-8** — Estándar de estilo de código Python
</span><span>- **TDD** — Pruebas escritas antes de implementar cada función</span></code></pre></div></div>
<ol class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-decimal flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3" start="4">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><strong>Commit changes</strong> → <strong>Commit directly to MainBranch</strong></li>
</ol>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Dime cuando esté listo.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="flex justify-start opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 group-focus-within:opacity-100 transition" role="group" aria-label="Message actions"><div class="text-text-300"><div class="text-text-300 flex items-stretch justify-between"><button type="button" data-cds="Button" class="cds-reset group/btn relative isolate inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap select-none border-0 outline-none rounded h-control font-sans text-body font-medium [&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-50 disabled:pointer-events-none transition-shadow duration-fast focus-visible:shadow-focus text-primary aria-pressed:text-accent aspect-square w-control px-0  !text-muted hover:!text-primary" aria-label="Copiar" data-testid="action-bar-copy"><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -z-[1] rounded-[inherit] transition-colors duration-fast group-focus-visible/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] bg-transparent group-hover/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-aria-expanded/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover inset-0 group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent cds-btn-squish "></span><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 "><span class="relative"><span data-cds="Icon" class="transition-all opacity-100 scale-100" aria-hidden="true" style="font-family: var(--font-anthropicons, Anthropicons-Variable); font-feature-settings: &quot;liga&quot; 0; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-style: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; line-height: 1; width: 1em; height: 1em; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0; user-select: none; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 433.3;"></span><span data-cds="Icon" class="absolute inset-0 transition-all opacity-0 scale-50" aria-hidden="true" style="font-family: var(--font-anthropicons, Anthropicons-Variable); font-feature-settings: