</span></span><span><span class="token token table table-line"></span><span class="token token table table-data-rows" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">|</span><span class="token token table table-data-rows table-data"> POST </span><span class="token token table table-data-rows" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">|</span><span class="token token table table-data-rows table-data"> /pagos/ </span><span class="token token table table-data-rows" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">|</span><span class="token token table table-data-rows table-data"> Procesar pago </span><span class="token token table table-data-rows" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">|</span><span class="token token table table-data-rows">
