          ease-[cubic-bezier(0.165,0.85,0.45,1)] h-8 w-8 rounded-md backdrop-blur-md _fill_10ocf_9 _ghost_10ocf_96" type="button" aria-label="Copiar al portapapeles" data-state="closed"><div class="relative"><div class="transition-all opacity-100 scale-100" style="width: 20px; height: 20px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="transition-all opacity-100 scale-100" aria-hidden="true" style="flex-shrink: 0;"><path d="M12.5 3A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 14 4.5V6h1.5A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 17 7.5v8a1.5 1.5 0 0 1-1.5 1.5h-8A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 6 15.5V14H4.5A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 3 12.5v-8A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 4.5 3zm1.5 9.5a1.5 1.5 0 0 1-1.5 1.5H7v1.5a.5.5 0 0 0 .5.5h8a.5.5 0 0 0 .5-.5v-8a.5.5 0 0 0-.5-.5H14zM4.5 4a.5.5 0 0 0-.5.5v8a.5.5 0 0 0 .5.5h8a.5.5 0 0 0 .5-.5v-8a.5.5 0 0 0-.5-.5z"></path></svg></div><div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center"><div class="transition-all opacity-0 scale-50" style="width: 20px; height: 20px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="transition-all opacity-0 scale-50" aria-hidden="true" style="flex-shrink: 0;"><path d="M15.188 5.11a.5.5 0 0 1 .752.626l-.056.084-7.5 9a.5.5 0 0 1-.738.033l-3.5-3.5-.064-.078a.501.501 0 0 1 .693-.693l.078.064 3.113 3.113 7.15-8.58z"></path></svg></div></div></div></button></div></div><div class="overflow-x-auto"><pre class="code-block__code !my-0 !rounded-lg !text-sm !leading-relaxed p-3.5" style="color: rgb(234, 236, 240); background: transparent; font-family: var(--font-mono);"><code style="color: rgb(234, 236, 240); background: transparent; font-family: var(--font-mono); white-space: pre-wrap;"><span><span>
</span></span><span>## Flujo de una Petición
</span><span>
</span><span>1. El cliente envía una petición HTTP a FastAPI
</span><span>2. FastAPI valida y enruta al router correspondiente
</span><span>3. El router ejecuta la lógica de negocio
</span><span>4. SQLAlchemy traduce las operaciones a SQL sobre SQLite
</span><span>5. Si hay eventos clave (pago, cambio de estado), el servicio de notificaciones envía correo o SMS
</span><span>6. FastAPI serializa la respuesta y la retorna al cliente
</span><span>
</span><span>## Tecnologías por Capa
</span><span>
</span><span>| Capa | Tecnología | Archivo |
</span><span>|---|---|---|
</span><span>| API Gateway | FastAPI | main.py |
</span><span>| Autenticación | passlib + bcrypt | routers/auth.py |
</span><span>| Catálogo | FastAPI router | routers/productos.py |
</span><span>| Carrito | FastAPI router | routers/carrito.py |
</span><span>| Pedidos | FastAPI router | routers/pedidos.py |
</span><span>| Pagos | FastAPI router | routers/pagos.py |
</span><span>| ORM | SQLAlchemy | database.py |
</span><span>| Base de datos | SQLite | coquito_amarillo.db |
</span><span>| Notificaciones | Python logging | services/notificaciones.py |
</span><span>| Pruebas | pytest + httpx | tests/ |
</span><span>| CI/CD | GitHub Actions | .github/workflows/ci.yml |</span></code></pre></div></div>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Agrégalo al final del archivo <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">DIAGRAMAS_UML.md</code> que ya tienes — entra al archivo, clic en el</p></div></div><div class="mt-2 pl-1"><div data-cds="Banner" class="flex items-start gap-xs rounded-card px-lg py-md font-sans text-body bg-surface-1 text-primary shadow-card-ring w-full"><span class="flex h-[1lh] shrink-0 items-center text-secondary"><span data-cds="Icon" aria-hidden="true" style="font-family: var(--font-anthropicons, Anthropicons-Variable); font-feature-settings: &quot;liga&quot; 0; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-style: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; line-height: 1; width: 1em; height: 1em; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0; user-select: none; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 433.3;"></span></span><div class="flex flex-wrap items-start gap-y-sm gap-x-md flex-1"><div class="min-w-[min(20ch,100%)] flex-1">La respuesta de Claude fue interrumpida.</div><span class="-ml-[2px] -mr-[calc(var(--cds-pad-md)-2px)] flex h-[1lh] shrink-0 items-center"><button type="button" data-cds="Button" data-size="sm" class="cds-reset group/btn relative isolate inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap select-none border-0 outline-none rounded h-control font-sans text-body font-medium [&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-50 disabled:pointer-events-none transition-shadow duration-fast focus-visible:shadow-focus text-primary aria-pressed:text-accent px-md  "><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -z-[1] rounded-[inherit] transition-colors duration-fast group-focus-visible/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] bg-fill-secondary group-hover/btn:bg-fill-secondary-hover group-aria-expanded/btn:bg-fill-secondary-hover inset-0 group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent group