: auto; font-style: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; line-height: 1; width: 1em; height: 1em; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0; user-select: none; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 433.3;"></span></span></span></button><div class="flex items-center"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="[content-visibility:auto] [contain-intrinsic-size:auto_400px] pb-8 -mb-8 print:[content-visibility:visible]"><div data-test-render-count="1"><div class="group" style="height: auto; opacity: 1; transform: none;"><div class="contents"><div data-is-streaming="false" class="group relative relative pb-3" style="opacity: 1; transform: none;"><h2 class="sr-only select-none">Claude respondió: Veo que Johan ya subió código propio.</h2><div class="font-claude-response relative leading-[1.65rem] [&amp;_pre&gt;div]:bg-bg-000/50 [&amp;_pre&gt;div]:border-0.5 [&amp;_pre&gt;div]:border-border-400 [&amp;_.ignore-pre-bg&gt;div]:bg-transparent [&amp;_.standard-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pl-2 [&amp;_.standard-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,ul,ol,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pr-8 [&amp;_.progressive-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pl-2 [&amp;_.progressive-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,ul,ol,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pr-8"><div><div class="standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid [&amp;_&gt;_*]:min-w-0 gap-3 standard-markdown"><p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Veo que Johan ya subió código propio. Tiene una estructura diferente a la que construimos — usa <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">app.py</code> en vez de <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">main.py</code> y tiene una carpeta <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">sample_data</code>. Lo que le falta comparado con lo que necesita el proyecto es:</p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>Lo que tiene:</strong></p>
<ul class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">✅ models/</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">✅ routers/</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">✅ database.py</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">✅ requirements.txt</li>
</ul>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>Lo que le falta:</strong></p>
<ul class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">❌ tests/ — las pruebas automatizadas</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">❌ services/ — notificaciones</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">❌ .github/workflows/ci.yml — el CI/CD</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">❌ README.md completo</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">❌ MANUAL_USUARIO.md</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">❌ MANUAL_TECNICO.md</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">❌ HISTORIAS_USUARIO.md</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">❌ DIAGRAMAS_UML.md</li>
