ntación.</p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Para hacer un commit desde tu cuenta necesitas:</p>
<ol class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-decimal flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Entrar al repositorio de Johan <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">https://github.com/sebasbarrera14/CDS01-201-5-20261</code></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Que Johan te agregue como colaborador — así puedes hacer commits directamente ahí.</li>
</ol>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>Johan hace esto:</strong></p>
<ol class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-decimal flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Entra al repositorio</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Clic en <strong>Settings</strong></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Clic en <strong>Collaborators</strong> en el menú izquierdo</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Clic en <strong>Add people</strong></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Escribe tu usuario de GitHub <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">MikeyGonDEV</code></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Clic en <strong>Add collaborator</strong></li>
</ol>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Tú recibirás un correo con la invitación — acéptala y listo, ya puedes hacer commits en el repo de Johan desde tu cuenta.</p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">¿Johan está contigo ahora para hacer eso?</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="flex justify-start opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 group-focus-within:opacity-100 transition" role="group" aria-label="Message actions"><div class="text-text-300"><div class="text-text-300 flex items-stretch justify-between"><button type="button" data-cds="Button" class="cds-reset group/btn relative isolate inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap select-none border-0 outline-none rounded h-control font-sans text-body font-medium [&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-50 disabled:pointer-events-none transition-shadow duration-fast focus-visible:shadow-focus text-primary aria-pressed:text-accent aspect-square w-control px-0  !text-muted hover:!text-primary" aria-label="Copiar" data-testid="action-bar-copy"><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -z-[1] rounded-[inherit] transition-colors duration-fast group-focus-visible/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] bg-transparent group-hover/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-aria-expanded/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover inset-0 group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent cds-btn-squish "></span><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 "><span class="relative"><span data-cds="Icon" class="transition-all opacity-100 scale-100" aria-hidden="true" style="font-family: var(--font-anthropicons, Anthropicons-Variable); font-feature-settings: &quot;liga&quot; 0; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-style: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; line-height: 1; width: 1em; height: 1em; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0; user-select: none; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 433.3;"></span><span data-cds="Icon" class="absolute inset-0 transition-all opacity-0 scale-50" aria-hidden="true" style="font-family: var(--font-anthropicons, Anthropicons-Variable); font