<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><strong>MikeyGonDEV</strong> — Add DIAGRAMAS_UML.md</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><strong>MikeyGonDEV</strong> — Add HISTORIAS_USUARIO.md</li>
