<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Para cerrar cada uno de los de Johan:</p>
<ol class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-decimal flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Entra al Issue</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Escribe un comentario: <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">Completado</code></li>
